  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "heldout-ownership-renewal-call:seg:0",
      "text": "Northwind Freight's renewal is up on the 30th, and their usage dropped about a third since summer."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-ownership-renewal-call:seg:1",
      "text": "Their main champion left in September. The new ops lead hasn't logged in once."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-ownership-renewal-call:seg:2",
      "text": "That's the risk. If nobody talks to the new lead before procurement does, they'll cut seats."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-ownership-renewal-call:seg:3",
      "text": "Do we know what they actually use now?"
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-ownership-renewal-call:seg:4",
      "text": "Mostly route planning. Nobody touches the reporting module anymore."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-ownership-renewal-call:seg:5",
      "text": "OK. We'll handle the renewal call with their new ops lead this month. Walk them through route planning, ask what reporting would need to do for them."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-ownership-renewal-call:seg:6",
      "text": "Sounds right."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-ownership-renewal-call:seg:7",
      "text": "Should we offer a smaller tier if they push on price?"
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-ownership-renewal-call:seg:8",
      "text": "Only if they bring it up. Don't lead with a discount."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-ownership-renewal-call:seg:9",
      "text": "I'll pull their usage by team so we have numbers on the call."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-ownership-renewal-call:seg:10",
      "text": "And I'll send the new lead the onboarding guide this week, so they've seen the product before the call."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-ownership-renewal-call:seg:11",
      "text": "Good. Let's keep this tight, it's a big account."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-ownership-renewal-call:seg:12",
      "text": "Agreed."
    }
  ],
